 <h3><u>Rahe Salamat Ta Qayamat</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>hussain maula hussain&nbsp;<br> sina pe bol raha hai<br> hussain ibne ali&nbsp;<br> lahu me apne naha kar<br> hazaar sadme utha kar<br> yazidiyat ko mita kar</p> 
  <p>khuda ke deen ka parcham baland maine kiya<br> kisi yazeed me taaqat kahaan jhukaaye mujhe<br> safar ba noke sina par pasand maine kiya<br> sune ye saara zamaana hussain ki aawaaz</p> 
  <p>ash’hado an la elaha illalla<br> ash’hado anna mohammad ur rasulallah<br> ash’hado anna aliyun valiullah</p> 
  <p>qubul is liye neze ki nok ki maine<br> mera kata huwa sar dushmanon se past na ho<br> mein sar uthaaye huwe dushmanon se kehta hun<br> hussain hota wahi hai jise shikast na ho<br> mere azaadaaro ay mere ghamkhaaro&nbsp;<br> tumhaare azm ko mera salaam</p> 
  <p>maula hussain sarkaar farmaate hain<br> ye mera ishq hai jo lahu banke tumhaari ragon me daur raha hai<br> rahe salaamat ta qayaamat&nbsp;<br> rahe salaamat ishqe hussaini<br> range wafa dikhlaata hai<br> warna kaun kisi ki khaatir<br> apna khun bahaata hai</p> 
  <p>rahe salaamat ta qayaamat&nbsp;<br> rahe salamat ishqe hussaini<br> range wafa dikhlaata hai</p> 
  <p>ye kaale kapre jo zebe tan hain<br> ishqe hussaini ki hai daleel<br> jhule amaari taaziyadaari<br> sina zani paani ki sabil<br> ehle aza ko ye tehzeebe<br> ishqe hussain sikhaata hai</p> 
  <p>ye chote bachche aur shab bedaari<br> yun to bara mushkil hai safar<br> socho agar tum ahle zamana<br> ishqe hussaini ka hai asar<br> ishqe hussain hi in bachchon ko<br> farshe aza tak laata hai</p> 
  <p>dekho zara tum kaabe me jaakar<br> sirf musalmaan honge wahaan<br> farshe aza wo waahid jagah hai<br> apne paraaye sab hai jahaan<br> aata wahi hai farshe aza par<br> jisko hussain bulaata hai</p> 
  <p>wo jo bina-e farshe aza hai<br> ham hain usi bibi ki duaayen<br> ishqe hussaini tha uske dil me<br> aur ham ko virse me mila<br> jisko mila virse me ye maatam&nbsp;<br> ahle aza kehlaata hai</p> 
  <p>ishqe hussaini dil me basaa kar<br> zinda rakhi ghazi ne wafa<br> jis ne wafa ko zinda rakha hai<br> baali sakina ka hai chacha<br> usko dua deti hai sakina<br> jo bhi alam ko uthaata hai</p> 
  <p>ishqe hussaini se hain namazein&nbsp;<br> ishqe hussaini farshe aza<br> ishqe hussaini sholon pe chalne<br> sina zani zanjeer o kama<br> ishqe hussaini ki taaqat se<br> maatami khun me nahaata hai</p> 
  <p>suno mazhar o irfan<br> ay azaadaaraane man<br> yehi wo shohada-e karbala hain<br> jinhon ne halmin ki sada par labbaik kaha<br> aur mere iskq me apni jaanon ka nazraana pesh kiya</p> 
